---
import Layout from "./Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="typeset max-w-[calc(100%-2em)] mx-auto">
    <div class="xl:max-w-7xl typeset-external-link">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-7xl text-pretty">
        Hey, I'm <span class="text-primary">JW</span>! a Full-Stack Developer from Cologne, Germany
      </h1>
      <p class="lg:text-4xl lg:leading-14 text-foreground/80 [&>a]:text-primary">
        I'm focusing on building web applications with{" "}
        <a href="https://tanstack.com/" target="_blank">TanStack</a>. Since it provides most of the features you need
        to build a web app, even some more complex ones, with server actions or middleware, I didn't get the chance to
        test out any backend frameworks like <a href="https://hono.dev/" target="_blank">Hono</a> or{" "}
        <a href="https://elysiajs.com/" target="_blank">Elisya</a>. But what I got around to test out is{" "}
        <a href="https://effect.website/" target="_blank">EffectTs</a>, which has been amazing fun so far and proved as
        great opportunity to learn a new way of programming.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
